Market Challenges
•	Feedstock Price Volatility - Fluctuating ethylene prices (comprising over 60% of production costs) create margin pressures, exacerbated by geopolitical tensions and supply chain disruptions.
•	Environmental Regulations - Stricter VOC emission standards in North America and Europe increase compliance costs, while sustainability trends push some end-users toward bio-based alternatives.
•	Technological Limitations - Existing oligomerization processes face efficiency challenges in selective production of C4 and C6 fractions.
